  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/132">
        <tei:head xml:lang="en">Psalm 132</tei:head>
        <tei:p><tei:note type="instruction" xml:lang="en">David sings with joy at his appointment to make the preparations for the building of God's Holy Dwelling, and for God's promise that he and his descendants will be the eternal bearers of the royal kingdom of Israel.</tei:note><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/1"/>A Song of Ascents.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/2"/>Remember, Adonoy, unto David
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/3"/>all his afflictions.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/4"/>How he swore to Adonoy
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/5"/>and vowed to the Mighty One of Jacob.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/6"/>Surely I will not enter
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/7"/>into the tent of my house;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/8"/>nor will I go up
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/9"/>into the bed that is spread for me.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/10"/>Surely I will not give sleep to my eyes,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/11"/>nor slumber to my eyelids.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/12"/>Until I find a place for Adonoy,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/13"/>dwelling places for the Mighty One of Jacob.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/14"/>Behold, we heard of it as being in Ephrath;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/15"/>we found it in the fields of the forest.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/16"/>Let us come to His Tabernacles,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/17"/>let us prostrate ourselves at His footstool.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/18"/>Arise Adonoy to Your resting place,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/19"/>You and the Ark of Your strength.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/20"/>Let Your priests
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/21"/>clothe themselves in righteousness,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/22"/>and let Your devoted ones sing in joy.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/23"/>For the sake of David Your servant,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/24"/>do not reject Your annointed.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/25"/>Adonoy swore to David,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/26"/>a truth from which He will not turn back,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/27"/>“Of the fruit of your womb
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/28"/>I will set upon your throne.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/29"/>If your children will preserve My covenant
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/30"/>and My testimony that I will teach them;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/31"/>then their children too
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/32"/>will forever sit on your throne.”
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/33"/>For Adonoy has chosen Zion;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/34"/>He desired it for His Dwelling Place.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/35"/>“This is My resting place forever,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/36"/>here I will dwell for I have desired it.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/37"/>Her provision I will abundantly bless;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/38"/>her needy I will satiate with bread.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/39"/>And her priests
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/40"/>I will clothe with deliverance
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/41"/>and her devoted ones will sing for joy.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/42"/>There will I cause to spring up
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/43"/>the horn of David
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/44"/>[there] have I ordered a lamp
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/45"/>for my annointed.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/46"/>His enemies I will clothe with shame,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/132/47"/>but upon him his crown will shine.”</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
